      "title": "Request flow",
      "items": [
        "Sign in \u2192 receive token \u2192 call API \u2192 read/write data.",
        "Responses return along the request path; maps are called directly."
      ]
    },
    {
      "dot": "rose",
      "title": "Proposed trust model",
      "items": [
        "Assumption: OIDC with PKCE; API validates tokens using Keycloak keys.",
        "Databases accept backend access only; boundaries are conceptual."
      ]
    },
    {
      "dot": "slate",
      "title": "Development & scope",
